      "passageSha256": "d79143040d4b24eb2af6cb29e82c0c376729a86b20f3606763c13f731ec3ffed",
      "pdfPages": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0098",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s06-p052-02040-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Memorable: life is vivid.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d0c54a366591ba32857888f949278feb9a6a19020bc69333f5e9d8385db429d3",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s06-p052-02040-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-058",
      "parentFingerprint": "8b924bbe561272c98c5286f71f3a32620bece45a44f47c38f1dd85ab4b6a23a8",
      "passageSha256": "d79143040d4b24eb2af6cb29e82c0c376729a86b20f3606763c13f731ec3ffed",
      "pdfPages": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0099",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s06-p052-02040-s009",
      "sentenceText": "Together, our findings paint a clear picture (see also Table 1 in Chapter 1).",
      "sentenceSha256": "450c25aa07bec294ac5f280c0b735d2e19419f657b2710eb56436b784d139da7",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s06-p052-02040-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-059",
      "parentFingerprint": "7891ab0bcec318cada0ba71d19d85053d03ffc1424af5149032d6f6bf59debef",
      "passageSha256": "5113e161b3c6b4b8d6abc3b19360313818489f6a493fba3225b3fd07381b388c",
      "pdfPages": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0001",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p053-03262-s001",
      "sentenceText": "As interesting as Joy Ryan and Linda’s lives are, they also feel exceptional.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c83bc3cd3766295761d718b7224fd5acc969c29a8b0592ad1f70e61ab62b3536",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p053-03262-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-001",
      "parentFingerprint": "dc83d7508abb8bc737714ff88797681995dcf1e0807927036d1db3470af73c7b",
      "passageSha256": "85148c519c547748b9a7a537069e2abe9f74d1d6c0d14e384acd4621a8bc5bd5",
      "pdfPages": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0002",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p053-03262-s002",
      "sentenceText": "How common is it for ordinary folks to live a psychologically rich life?",
      "sentenceSha256": "0b9d36970c5c3f9619b04ec98d2d72edde6f20ae2f71f561af26697d3bdb3a7e",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p053-03262-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-001",
      "parentFingerprint": "dc83d7508abb8bc737714ff88797681995dcf1e0807927036d1db3470af73c7b",
      "passageSha256": "85148c519c547748b9a7a537069e2abe9f74d1d6c0d14e384acd4621a8bc5bd5",
      "pdfPages": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0003",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p053-03262-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Is there any scientific evidence that a sizable number of people are leading psychologically rich lives?",
      "sentenceSha256": "c8a0d2470da0ef2e8cbcca8dbcb757f89914ee6c2d945db7604d812707343c17",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p053-03262-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-001",
      "parentFingerprint": "dc83d7508abb8bc737714ff88797681995dcf1e0807927036d1db3470af73c7b",
      "passageSha256": "85148c519c547748b9a7a537069e2abe9f74d1d6c0d14e384acd4621a8bc5bd5",
      "pdfPages": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0004",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p053-04238-s001",
      "sentenceText": "We realized that we had a valuable tool to evaluate people’s lives at the end of them, in their obituaries.",
      "sentenceSha256": "777cfa97380652952f614037afc1d3ba1c0ce84afc106ccf4d3960dc24fd9841",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p053-04238-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-002",
      "parentFingerprint": "99174bbf516e492e952c1f13a508c027061851fcd523ab699da643b5147e61cd",
      "passageSha256": "951122bea6b755997fe92d0310fc4c2aa26344ea1fedbedba3aaf7e0e3a12527",
      "pdfPages": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0005",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p053-04238-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Perhaps by analyzing their contents, we could figure out how happy, meaningful, and psychologically rich a person’s life was.",
      "sentenceSha256": "15e6612e106e3bb2676c167c478a586cb40dee099fd66d79d615540150e6ceab",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p053-04238-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-002",
      "parentFingerprint": "99174bbf516e492e952c1f13a508c027061851fcd523ab699da643b5147e61cd",
      "passageSha256": "951122bea6b755997fe92d0310fc4c2aa26344ea1fedbedba3aaf7e0e3a12527",
      "pdfPages": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0006",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p053-05408-s001",
      "sentenceText": "We hired three research assistants and asked them to read and rate New York Times obituaries, 101 of them, in June 2016, using twelve different themes.",
      "sentenceSha256": "411a8ee3a0dd34e2354671d6b5bc553fb338323278cbca167637789e2c0ef5a1",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p053-05408-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-003",
      "parentFingerprint": "0a77406fcbb64ce35b34940d80e1b03e7253640d813605c0f16246c9943bd8d0",
      "passageSha256": "e749f541a57030d363762a02f8e65d6c4d26a99af07bc77b646d0b78dc203c14",
      "pdfPages": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0007",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p053-05408-s004",
      "sentenceText": "We then asked them to rate each life, on a scale of 1 to 5, by answering questions such as, “How happy was this person’s life?,” “How fulfilling?,” and “How interesting?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "cf9e8e00a803abc8eae8f859bf251f29260bd043ad7e34512e19162d69682bc9",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p053-05408-r003-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-004",
      "parentFingerprint": "1cd215643441ae36bdd5a3d6e7e4ab37b72a87085647e50421ba676eb65b952d",
      "passageSha256": "b4f68697401a8d78cef7ac838c9756fe8f4a8be6214160eae692d2963c7b4307",
      "pdfPages": [
        53,
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0008",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p054-01335-s001",
      "sentenceText": "First, how many of the people profiled led a happy life, a meaningful life, or a psychologically rich life?",
      "sentenceSha256": "7e629997f1d92e4633e73dba25be8e603429e5d0f75b4b07fd8b2045875355a7",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p054-01335-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "bf9a58a92f8ec49104e1fd6848ec06cb3bfd643995694763e045c85e231be078",
      "passageSha256": "144ce02b0d9cfef78aa4b2d714372157aac7996722fcfc19344d3594b9f285c9",
      "pdfPages": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0009",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p054-01335-s003",
      "sentenceText": "This is quite a high bar.",
      "sentenceSha256": "506c557bd51aedcef2cfd3df47370ee841eb83130eca1833ff663317ac3e14e1",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p054-01335-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "bf9a58a92f8ec49104e1fd6848ec06cb3bfd643995694763e045c85e231be078",
      "passageSha256": "144ce02b0d9cfef78aa4b2d714372157aac7996722fcfc19344d3594b9f285c9",
      "pdfPages": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0010",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p054-01335-s004",
      "sentenceText": "According to this criterion, fifteen people of the 101 obituaries featured in The New York Times that month led a psychologically rich life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "57fb31409804945bef17f786d251dd5fa475f37f974890fcdb9f5511b54bd2e7",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p054-01335-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "bf9a58a92f8ec49104e1fd6848ec06cb3bfd643995694763e045c85e231be078",
      "passageSha256": "144ce02b0d9cfef78aa4b2d714372157aac7996722fcfc19344d3594b9f285c9",
      "pdfPages": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0011",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p054-01335-s006",
      "sentenceText": "In general, then, there were more people who led a happy or meaningful life than those who led a psychologically rich life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8a1bbed45eb42b9fd3589a47f91a846ecf1bd79f8848c3e32b3194890e1f7712",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p054-01335-r005-006",
